  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You step through the inky wells of blackness in the spaces between worlds.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Shadow Walker<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can expend one use of mythic power and one use of your shadow walk spell-like ability to enable you to dimension door a number of times equal to one-half your mythic power, as long as all are used within a number of minutes equal to your mythic tier. When using these dimension doors, you may expend one additional use of mythic power to use mythic dimension door instead, and when you arrive the destination is filled with darkness until the end of your next turn.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-n-s-feats#toc48\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
